 "attribution": "Before the first frame the browser host spends ~2.2 s on SHA-256 (PortableSHA256: every packaged file, 757.7 MB, digested by the loading packages ≈ 379 MB/s), ~1.1 s waiting for the prefetch (network and cache writes; it runs before the program starts), ~0.8 s in its synchronous reads from the cache (~1.7 s from the runner's local server), ~0.5 s in LZ4 (the load's memory measure, M1). Under Node WASI the WASI imports (wasm-to-js, reads among other calls — an inference) take 1.2 s",
 "shaBenchmark": {
  "how": "an unrolled C SHA-256 block function compiled for wasm32-wasip1 with the SDK's clang -O3, 11 passes over 64 MiB in memory under Node 26 (scratch only, not in the repository)",
